        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Does flattening remove hidden metadata?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "It removes document-level metadata and revision history carried in the interactive layer. For a thorough clean before sharing — author names, GPS data, tracked changes — run the privacy scanner as well."
